        "id": 226284,
        "name": "Cult of Gloom",
        "username": "Cult_of_Gloom",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/cult_of_gloom/{size}/1878_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-04-03T00:57:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Something like this?</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><span><span><b>Papa Malhuer&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; HP 40 (plus 5 per H)</b></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><b>Powers&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Qualities&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Status</b></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>Voodoo d10&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Magical Lore d10&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 0 hinders on heroes: d12</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>Necromancy d8&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Leadership d8&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1-2 hinders on heroes: d10&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>Presence d8&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Banter d8&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3-4 hinders on heroes: d8</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>Vitality d6&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;5+ hinders on heroes: d6</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><b>Abilities</b></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><b>Soul Harvest&nbsp; A</b>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Hinder a target using Voodoo, use the Max die. Create a number of minions equal to the size of this hinder. They are of Mid die size and have the Voodoo curse rule. </span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><b>Snake Eyes A</b>&nbsp; Attack a target using Necromancy, use the Max plus min die. You may use any hinders on that target as though they were a boost on you. </span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><b>Consume Essence&nbsp; R</b>&nbsp; When a minion is destroyed roll its die, you recover that much health</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><b>From Bad to Worse&nbsp; R</b>&nbsp; When a hero creates a twist, hinder them with banter</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><b>Master of Misfortune I</b>&nbsp; Whenever Papa Malheur is in a situation in which he could only possibly succeed by a stroke of someone else’s bad luck, he automatically succeeds in Overcomes to accomplish a task by exploiting the misfortune of others. </span></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><span><span><strong>Voodoo curse minion rule</strong>: When this minion is destroyed, roll its die and hinder the hero that destroyed it. </span></span></span></p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:00:09.485Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
